{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01MPjVfZ79cVVQAWQnnxVvjX", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.wi-fi.org/node/36326\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wi-fi.org/beacon/the-beacon/from-niche-to-mainstream-wi-fi-alliance-founders-share-the-story-behind-the-early\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.eetimes.com/?p=1139992\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1960\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.widescreenreview.com/news_detail.php?id=955\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dev.wi-fi.org/beacon/jeff-abramowitz/wi-fi-alliance-then-and-now\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.edn.com/?p=4038578\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1956\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1957\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1961\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:05:25.190Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Phil Belanger first chairman WECA Wireless Ethernet Compatibility Alliance", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01AtXxACXYosHmSe6yQZyQdR", "content": [{"title": "www.wi-fi.org", "url": "https://www.wi-fi.org/node/36326"}, {"title": "The Beacon", "url": "https://wi-fi.org/beacon/the-beacon/from-niche-to-mainstream-wi-fi-alliance-founders-share-the-story-behind-the-early"}, {"title": "www.eetimes.com", "url": "https://www.eetimes.com/?p=1139992"}, {"title": "www.wi-fi.org", "url": "https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1960"}, {"title": "news detail", "url": "https://www.widescreenreview.com/news_detail.php?id=955"}, {"title": "Wi-Fi Alliance®, then and now", "url": "https://dev.wi-fi.org/beacon/jeff-abramowitz/wi-fi-alliance-then-and-now"}, {"title": "www.edn.com", "url": "https://www.edn.com/?p=4038578"}, {"title": "www.wi-fi.org", "url": "https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1956"}, {"title": "www.wi-fi.org", "url": "https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1957"}, {"title": "www.wi-fi.org", "url": "https://www.wi-fi.org/node/1961"}]}, "Phil Belanger is well documented as the first chairman of WECA, which was founded in 1999. A Wi-Fi Alliance Beacon article describes him as former Chairman of Wi-Fi Alliance from 1999 - 2001 and says he is now CEO of PB Ventures. Wi-Fi Alliance's own history calls him WECA's first chairman.\n\nContemporary 1999 coverage names him as chairman when the group launched. An EE Times report spells his name \"Bellanger\" and says he was of Aironet. A 1999 Widescreen Review article identifies him as vice President of Strategic Development at Aironet. Later WECA press releases from December 1999 and July 2000 also name him as chairman.\n\nThe sources agree on the core facts. Minor discrepancies exist: the EE Times and EDN pieces spell his surname \"Bellanger,\" and the Widescreen Review piece refers to Aironet as the company where he worked."], "durationSeconds": 6.085461709, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MPjVfZ79cVVQAWQnnxVvjX", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDY9M3Dyq7jauUEXZawS", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：Phil Belanger（菲尔·贝朗格）**\n\n他 1999 年 WECA（后来的 Wi-Fi Alliance）成立时出任首任主席，任期 1999–2001 年，当时在 Aironet 工作。2005 年 11 月他写信给 Boing Boing，说 Wi-Fi 什么都不代表，不是缩写，也没有含义。这个名字是品牌公司 Interbrand 起的。\"Wireless Fidelity\" 只是联盟早期用过一阵的宣传语，他后来说用这句是个错误。\n\n搜了 2 次。早年的 EE Times 和 EDN 报道把他的姓拼成 \"Bellanger\"。\n\n依据：\n- [Boing Boing 2005-11-08 原帖：\"wifi isnt short for\"](https://boingboing.net/2005/11/08/wifi-isnt-short-for.html)\n- [Mental Floss: What Does 'Wi-Fi' Stand For?](https://www.mentalfloss.com/technology/what-does-wi-fi-stand-for)\n- [Wi-Fi Alliance Beacon：创始人讲述早期历史](https://wi-fi.org/beacon/the-beacon/from-niche-to-mainstream-wi-fi-alliance-founders-share-the-story-behind-the-early)\n- [EE Times 1999 年报道](https://www.eetimes.com/?p=1139992)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1122, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5546, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1122}, "output_tokens": 487, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:05:31.563Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDY9Ln7F2vmQAGteC9ty"}
